  terms: {
    clientTitle: 'Terms and conditions of use',
    providerTitle: 'Terms and Conditions',
    close: 'Close',
    accept: 'I have read and understood',
    lastUpdated: 'Last update',
    clientTerms: 'TERMS AND CONDITIONS - GLAMGO MARRAKECH\nHome Services Platform - Customer Area\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nREGISTRATION AND ACCESS\n- Account creation mandatory with accurate information: first name, last name, email, telephone.\n- Date of birth required - You must be 18 years of age or older.\n- Full address with city required for service location.\n- Information must be kept up to date.\n\nIDENTITY AND PERSONAL USE\n- The registered customer is the direct beneficiary of the service.\n- It is forbidden to book for others without clearly indicating it.\n- Immediate suspension in the event of fraudulent use.\n\nOBLIGATIONS\n- Respect of schedules, honest advice, respectful behavior.\n\nCANCELLATION AND REFUND POLICY\n- No charge for cancellations up to 2 hours in advance.\n- Less than 2 hours → possible charges.\n- Absence without cancellation → service due in full.\n- Cancellation by the Provider → full refund.\n- Force majeure → adapted conditions.\n- Reimbursement within 7 to 14 working days.\n\nPROTECTION AND SECURITY\n- Right to refuse service in case of danger or inappropriate behavior.\n- Rapid reporting via the application.\n- Immediate suspension of Service Providers in the event of violent or disrespectful behavior.\n- Enhanced confidentiality of personal data.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nCOMMON PROVISIONS (Providers & Customers)\n\n- Mandatory authenticity: each account must be used only by the person registered.\n- Responsibility: GlamGo Marrakech is an intermediary and is not responsible for the quality of services, disputes or damages.\n- Personal data: collected and processed in accordance with Moroccan law 09-08, never sold to third parties.\n- Modification of terms and conditions: GlamGo may modify the terms and conditions at any time, notification via the application or email.\n- Zero tolerance: immediate suspension in the event of violent, discriminatory or threatening behavior.\n- Reporting system: integrated tool for danger or abuse.\n- Communication: via WhatsApp or telephone, GlamGo can contact for service or support.\n- Termination: account deletion possible at any time; suspension in case of violation.\n- Applicable law: Moroccan law, competent courts of Marrakech.\n- Coverage area: commitment to serve selected areas, travel expenses negotiable.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nFINAL NOTE\n\nAt GlamGo Marrakech, Customers and Service Providers work together towards a common goal: creating a community based on trust, quality and respect.\n\n"Life\'s battles are not won by the strongest, nor by the fastest, but by those who never give up." - King Hassan II\n\nBY CHECKING THE BOX, YOU CONFIRM THAT YOU HAVE READ, UNDERSTOOD AND AGREE TO ALL THE TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF USE.',
    providerTerms: 'TERMS AND CONDITIONS - GLAMGO MARRAKECH\nService Provider Area\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nREGISTRATION AND ACCESS\n- Exact personal information required: first name, last name, email, telephone, WhatsApp.\n- Date of birth required - You must be 18 years of age or older.\n- CIN (Carte d\'Identite Nationale) number required for identity verification.\n- Suspension possible in case of non-compliance or fraudulent information.\n\nPROFESSIONAL PROFILE\n- Detailed description of your services required (minimum 50 characters).\n- Years of experience required.\n- Moral commitment to practice with seriousness, honesty and respect.\n\nSUPPORTING DOCUMENTS\n- Proof of experience MANDATORY: certificate of employment, contracts, portfolio.\n- Diploma or certificate MANDATORY for: hairdressing, esthetics, massage, make-up, facials, sports coaching.\n- Professional insurance HIGHLY RECOMMENDED.\n\nRATES\n- Rates are negotiated directly with each client.\n- Total transparency is required on prices and supplements.\n- You are free to set your own rates.\n\nSERVICE AREA\n- Main business address required.\n- Main city of service required.\n- Travel expenses negotiable according to distance.\n\nIDENTITY AND PERSONAL PERFORMANCE\n- The registered Service Provider is the only one authorized to perform the service.\n- Prohibition to delegate to a non-registered third party.\n- Immediate suspension in the event of undeclared substitution.\n\nOBLIGATIONS\n- Punctuality, quality, respect, confidentiality, legal compliance.\n- Compliance with schedules agreed with the customer.\n- Prohibition of fraud or manipulation of notices.\n\nCANCELLATION POLICY\n- Cancellation by the Provider → full refund to the Customer.\n- Repeated cancellations → negative impact and possible suspension.\n- Force majeure → adapted conditions.\n\nPROTECTION AND SAFETY\n- Right to refuse service if conditions unsafe.\n- Travel allowance in case of justified refusal.\n- Rapid reporting system via the application.\n- Data protection in accordance with Moroccan law 09-08.\n\nINSURANCE AND LIABILITY\n- You are responsible for any damage caused during your services.\n- GlamGo acts as an intermediary and is not responsible for the quality of services.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nCOMMON PROVISIONS (Providers & Customers)\n\n- Mandatory authenticity: each account must be used only by the person registered.\n- Responsibility: GlamGo Marrakech is an intermediary.\n- Personal data: collected according to Moroccan law 09-08, never sold.\n- Zero tolerance: suspension in case of violent or discriminatory behavior.\n- Applicable law: Moroccan law, courts of Marrakech.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nFINAL NOTE\n\nAt GlamGo Marrakech, Customers and Service Providers work together towards a common goal: creating a community based on trust, quality and respect.\n\n"Life\'s battles are not won by the strongest, nor by the fastest, but by those who never give up." - King Hassan II\n\nBY TICKING THE BOX, YOU CONFIRM THAT YOU HAVE READ, UNDERSTOOD AND ACCEPT THESE TERMS AND CONDITIONS IN FULL.'
  },
